sequenceDiagram
    participant App as Worker Mobile App
    participant Gateway as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Middleware
    participant ShiftAPI as Shift Service (API)
    participant Redis as Redis (Distributed Lock)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Outbox as Outbox Relay Worker
    participant MQ as Kafka (shift.claimed)
    participant Pay as Payment Service

    App->>Gateway: POST /api/v1/shifts/{id}/claim
    Gateway->>Auth: Validate JWT
    Auth-->>Gateway: 200 OK (worker_id extracted)
    Gateway->>ShiftAPI: Forward request
    ShiftAPI->>Redis: SETNX shift:lock:{id} (TTL 5s)
    alt Lock Failed
        Redis-->>ShiftAPI: Null (already locked)
        ShiftAPI-->>App: 409 Conflict (Try again shortly)
    else Lock Success
        Redis-->>ShiftAPI: OK
        ShiftAPI->>DB: BEGIN; SELECT * FROM shifts WHERE id=$1 FOR UPDATE;
        DB-->>ShiftAPI: Shift data
        ShiftAPI->>ShiftAPI: Validate status == 'OPEN'
        ShiftAPI->>DB: UPDATE shifts SET status='CLAIMED', worker_id=$2; INSERT INTO outbox...
        DB-->>ShiftAPI: COMMIT
        ShiftAPI->>Redis: DEL shift:lock:{id}
        ShiftAPI-->>App: 200 OK (Shift Claimed)
        
        loop Async Polling
            Outbox->>DB: SELECT * FROM outbox WHERE status='PENDING'
            Outbox->>MQ: Publish 'shift.claimed'
            Outbox->>DB: UPDATE outbox SET status='PROCESSED'
        end
        
        MQ->>Pay: Consume 'shift.claimed'
        Pay->>Pay: Capture pre-auth on Business card
    end
